    <briefdescription>
<para>A pooled, animated log notification text element managed by LogManager. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Slides from a start position to an end position over time, fades in while moving, lingers for a configurable duration, then returns itself to the pool. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
